<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Table 8: </span>Zero-shot retrieval performance on CUB test set using <math id="A3.T9.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> distance and inner product for similarity measure. R@<math id="A3.T9.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> denotes Recall at rank <math id="A3.T9.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>. Arrows indicate performance change direction after projection.</figcaption>
