<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Table 9: </span>Embedding reconstruction loss of images in the VizWiz, SeedBench, and FoodieQA datasets. We report both average loss (avg) and standard deviation (std). LLaVA’s visual embeddings exhibit lowest reconstruction error among all models. The reconstruction performance is consistent to what we have observed for the images in COCO and Flickr30k.</figcaption>
